tion an easy task.\n80 PLUS Standard Certified and Intel C6/C7 States Ready\nDeliver up to 86% efficiency under real world load conditions to promise lowest power losses. Additionally, the Smart Series\nhas been optimized to work with all generations of Intel’s processors to achieve maximum energy saving.\nHigh-Quality Components\nHigh quality components enable non-stop usage with stable and reliable performance, no more capacitor explosion and leakage.\nSingle +12V Output\nSmart Series is equipped with a powerful +12V rail, superior performance under all types of system loading. Please see the output specification below:\nProduct Specifications\nP/N\nPS-SPD-0430NPCWUS-W\nModel\nSP-430AH2NKW\nType\nIntel ATX 12V 2.3\nForm Factor\nATX\nRGB Fan\nNo\nWatts\n430W\nMax Output Capacity\n430W\nColor\nBlack\nPFC (Power Factor Correction)\nActive PFC\nPower Good Signal\n100-500 msec\nHold Up Time\n16msec (minimum) within 80% load\nInput Current\n8A max\nInput Frequency Range\n50 Hz - 60 Hz\nInput Voltage\n100Vac – 240Vac\nOperating Temperture\n5℃ to +40℃\nOperating Humidity\n20% to 85%,non-condensing\nStorage Temperture\n-40 ℃ to +55 ℃\nStorage Humidity\n10% to 95%, non-condensing\nCooling System\n120mm Fan: 1800 R.P.M. ± 10%\nEfficiency\n82-86% efficiency @ 20-100% load\nMTBF\n100,000 hrs minimum\nSafety Approval\nCE/CB/TUV/ UL/ FCC\nPCI-E 6+2PIN\nPCI-E 6+2pin x 2\nProtection\nOVP, OPP, SCP\nUser Manual\nFile Name\nDescription\nSize\nVersion\nRelease Date\nSMART 430W Manual\n2021-11-09\nConnect PCIe Cables to High Power Consumption GPU\n2022-07-18\nDrivers & Software\nFile Name\nDescription\nSize\nVersion\nRelease Date\nCONTACT\nCustomer Support\nSales Partner Request\nMedia Contact\nSUPPORT\nSubmit A Request\nWarranty Policy\nHow to Find S/N\neRMA Service\nSoftware Downloads\nCOMMUNITY\nJoin TT Mod\nCaseMOD Invitation\nPress Release\nMarketing Materials\n3D Maker\nCOMPANY\nAbout Us\nStore Policy\nWhere to Buy\nLANGUAGE\nUnited States/Canada\nBrazil\nLatam\nSubscribe to our